# Atraxa's trigger asks once for each card type that an untaken revealed card has, in the order Kindred, artifact, battle,
# creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery. Tarfire is a kindred instant: taken for kindred it is no
# longer there to be the instant, and nothing else is an instant, so no question is asked for it. Ornithopter, an artifact creature, is taken as the creature
# after Sol Ring was the artifact. Invasion of Gobakhan is the battle. "You may": nothing is taken for the land, so the
# Islands go to the bottom of the library with the eleventh card still on top.

